    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the world of Cryptower, an exciting tower defense experience where creativity and strategy intertwine in captivating gameplay. You'll have the opportunity to develop unique talents, enhance tower parameters, and unlock powerful abilities to triumph over endless waves of enemies. Immerse yourself in an enchanting world, become a master of defense, and protect your realm! Customize your defenses, outwit your foes, and rise to the pinnacle of mastery in the epic battle for survival in Cryptower!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress Mode</h2><br>Choose your path of development in the Progress Mode, where each step is a stepping stone towards greatness. Progress through levels, reinforce your ranks, explore talents and abilities that will shape your strategy. Conquer challenges, improve, and unlock the potential hidden deep within you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinity Mode</h2><br>Alternatively, step into the competition of the Endless Mode, where courage is defined by your score. Select from a diverse array of randomly generated maps, talents, and abilities to overcome all obstacles on the path to the leaderboard's summit. Here, every decision matters, and only the most inventive and persistent will succeed.<br><br>Craft your tactics, embody strategies, and prove that you are worthy of becoming great in this harmonious blend of tower defense, clicker, and roguelike.",
